  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Technical Assistance to Support Implementation of AGRI-CONNECT on Sector Enablers and Business Environment for Coffee, Tea and Horticulture in Tanzania</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">&lt;p&gt;The purpose of the TA contract is to provide Technical Assistance to the Ministry of Agriculture in mainland, the Ministry of Agriculture, Natural resources, Livestock and Fisheries in Zanzibar, and other relevant national and local institutions and actors along the value chain to improve the sector enablers and business environment for the tea, coffee and horticulture value chains, within the framework of the respective agricultural development strategies. This area relates to the implementation of Result 1 of Agriconnect. In addition, the Technical Assistance will provide overall coordination of the Agri-Connect programme components and will lead programme Monitoring, Evaluation, and Learning initiatives. This relates to &apos;&apos;Result 0&apos;&apos; of Agriconnect.&lt;/p&gt;</narrative>
  </description>
